@host = http://localhost:5053

### Inserir
POST {{host}}/api/teacher
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Silva",
  "email": "maria@uniaraxa.edu.br",
  "urlLattes": "http://lattes.cnpq.br/1234567890123456",
  "dataAdmissao": "2024-02-01T00:00:00"
}

### Listar todos
GET {{host}}/api/teacher

### Buscar por id
GET {{host}}/api/teacher/1

### Atualizar
PUT {{host}}/api/teacher/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Silva Souza",
  "email": "maria@uniaraxa.edu.br",
  "urlLattes": "http://lattes.cnpq.br/1234567890123456",
  "dataAdmissao": "2024-02-01T00:00:00"
}

### Remover
DELETE {{host}}/api/teacher/1
